@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：同步等待超时为何返回 UNKNOWN

actor Caller
participant MessageTemplate
participant MessageProvider
queue Broker

Caller -> MessageTemplate: send(confirmTimeout = 3s)
MessageTemplate -> MessageProvider: send(request)
MessageProvider -> Broker: publish
MessageTemplate -> MessageTemplate: wait future up to 3s

... 3 秒到达但 Future 未完成 ...
MessageTemplate --> Caller: UNKNOWN / TIMEOUT / CONFIRM

... 之后 Broker 可能才确认 ...
Broker --> MessageProvider: confirmed at 5s
MessageProvider -> MessageProvider: complete future CONFIRMED

note over Caller,Broker
UNKNOWN 不是 FAILED。
调用方不能因为超时就无条件创建新 messageId 重发，
否则可能产生重复业务消息。
end note
@enduml
